    sh:description "Radio subscriber number (Quoted as a 16 digit decimal number. The number is to be entered “left adjusted” starting with the first digit to be dialled. Padding by the special value F shall be added after the least significant digit of the number. For further information about NID_RADIO refer to SUBSET-054.)" ;
